I agree with you here, BUT my guess is that with polypiling removed I
would think that this problem would take care of itself.  In other words,
by removing polypiling the "power" disparity between characters and
all monsters will be diminished.  You may not have the full complement
of armor/weapons/magic items when descending into hell (if you make it
that far).  To test my hypothesis, from now on I only play without
using polypiling to see how much tougher it is.  I would like to see
others try this also and post their experiences.  My guess is that it will
make the game much more interesting.

